{"id":"vod_bf_37150","vodId":"37150","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"五等分的新娘第一季","name_cn":"五等分的新娘第一季","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-38/dfff403cfd9a5b7d6eed8b4f1b3dedb1.jpg"},"summary":"上杉风太郎（松冈祯丞 配音）是就读于高中二年级的平凡男生，唯一的亮点就是学习方面异常的优秀，每次考试都能得到满分。上杉的家境非常的贫穷，欠下了巨额债务，为了还债，上杉不得不开始勤工俭学，受中野一家人的聘用，成为了中野家五姐妹的家庭教师。　　有些腹黑的小恶魔中野一花（花泽香菜 配音）、个性傲娇厨艺绝佳的中野二乃（竹达彩奈 配音）、大大咧咧沉迷于战国时期历史的中野三玖（伊藤美来 配音）、非常擅长运动的元气少女中野四叶（佐仓绫音 配音）和个性有些要强的傲娇少女中野五月（水濑祈 配音），在这五位大小姐的包围下，上杉能够顺利完成自己的教学任务吗？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:50:49","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wudengfendexinniangdiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wudengfendexinniangdiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wudengfendexinniangdiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wudengfendexinniangdiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wudengfendexinniangdiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wudengfendexinniangdiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wudengfendexinniangdiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wudengfendexinniangdiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wudengfendexinniangdiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wudengfendexinniangdiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wudengfendexinniangdiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wudengfendexinniangdiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:31:08.2